OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies raping girl, 17, near
OL,4,APiccadilly Gardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied raping a teenage girl
OL,7,Fin Manchester.
OL,9,FAbdul Shinwari, 24, also pleaded not
OL,10,Fguilty to strangling the "vulnerable"
OL,11,F17-year-old and denied drugs offences.
OL,13,FShinwari appeared at Manchester Crown
OL,14,FCourt via video link from HMP Forest
OL,15,FBank, Salford, earlier to deny one
OL,16,Fcount of rape, one of intentional
OL,17,Fstrangulation, one of supplying
OL,18,Fcannabis and one of being concerned in
OL,19,Fthe supply of crack cocaine.
