OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies raping girl, 17, near
OL,4,APiccadilly Gardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rape offence is alleged to have
OL,7,Fbeen committed at about 01:30 BST on 14
OL,8,FJuly, on Hope Street near Piccadilly
OL,9,FGardens. He will be held in custody
OL,10,Funtil a further hearing on 21 December,
OL,11,Fahead of a trial on 18 January 2027.
